NOTE ON THE CONTENTS

The federal regulations, statutes, and CMS guidance documents cited throughout
this repository are public domain works of the United States Government and are
not claimed as proprietary. What is proprietary is the structured register, the
schema, the validation logic, the verification methodology, and the analysis —
including the identification of conflicts between CMS sources.

